   9:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  * This implementation is based on the paper from Gao and Mateer: <br>
  10:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  * Shuhong Gao and Todd Mateer, Additive Fast Fourier Transforms over Finite Fields,
  11:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  * IEEE Transactions on Information Theory 56 (2010), 6265--6272.
  12:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  * http://www.math.clemson.edu/~sgao/papers/GM10.pdf <br>
  13:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  * and includes improvements proposed by Bernstein, Chou and Schwabe here:
  14:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  * https://binary.cr.yp.to/mcbits-20130616.pdf
  15:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  */
