  54:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  *
  55:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  * Computes f0 and f1 such that f(x) = f0(x^2-x) + x.f1(x^2-x)
  56:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  * as proposed by Bernstein, Chou and Schwabe:
  57:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  * https://binary.cr.yp.to/mcbits-20130616.pdf
