  59:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  * @param[out] f0 Array half the size of f
  60:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  * @param[out] f1 Array half the size of f
  61:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  * @param[in] f Array of size a power of 2
  62:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  * @param[in] m_f 2^{m_f} is the smallest power of 2 greater or equal to the number of coefficients
  63:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/fft.c ****  */
